WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.411 --> 00:00:04.000
Unit twenty-one. Cloud Architecture Basics!

2
00:00:04.909 --> 00:00:09.899
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.949 --> 00:00:13.494
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.544 --> 00:00:17.905
Today we learn about Cloud Architecture Basics. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.871 --> 00:00:22.435
Cloud. Say it with me. Cloud!

6
00:00:25.924 --> 00:00:29.557
Server. Say it with me. Server!

7
00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:37.173
Scalability. Say it with me. Scalability!

8
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.496
Storage. Say it with me. Storage!

9
00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:51.823
Database. Say it with me. Database!

10
00:00:55.354 --> 00:01:00.276
Load balancer. Say it with me. Load balancer!

11
00:01:03.728 --> 00:01:07.489
Region. Say it with me. Region!

12
00:01:10.968 --> 00:01:14.513
Cost. Say it with me. Cost!

13
00:01:18.052 --> 00:01:30.434
Cloud architecture plans how a server, storage, and database work together. A load balancer spreads traffic for scalability, a region choice affects speed, and design affects cost.

14
00:01:30.484 --> 00:01:34.080
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:34.807 --> 00:01:39.889
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.939 --> 00:01:41.135
Scalability!

17
00:01:42.326 --> 00:01:47.549
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.599 --> 00:01:48.749
Region!

19
00:01:49.626 --> 00:01:55.962
Did you know? Cloud providers run data centres in many regions so services stay close to users!

20
00:01:56.012 --> 00:01:58.323
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:08.108
Think and answer. Why might a company choose servers in several regions?

22
00:02:08.158 --> 00:02:09.308
Great answer!

23
00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:15.994
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:16.044 --> 00:02:19.127
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

